      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The only way around this issue seems to be to use \"On Value Changed\"... but that comes with it's own issues.\n\n1. Changing the text / clearing out the text requires you to use \"SetTextWithoutNotify\" as otherwise you end up with two changed events.\n\n2. Testing in editor becomes close to impossible....",
