      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The problem appears to be with the in-game keyboard. Using VRCInputFieldKeyboardOverride with Override Behavior set to Override makes the events work again but disables the keyboard. \n\nFor now, I treat any OnValueChanged event while isFocused is false as an OnSubmit/OnEndEdit event.",
